      "statement": "setApiAddress persists a new address only after validation: it strips a trailing /api path suffix and any trailing slash from the input, probes the cleaned address with GET /api/health through the middleware (X-Target-API header), and only on an ok response writes it to localStorage and updates state, returning true; a failed probe or thrown error returns false and leaves the active address unchanged.",
