      "id": "claim_3939e99646a24d0e8749423a2c8e36fe",
      "statement": "fetchArdocoApi validates inputs before any fetch and throws: 'No selectedTraceLinkType provided' when no pipeline is selected; 'Find inconsistencies is only supported for SWATTR trace link type.' when findInconsistencies is combined with a type other than SAD_SAM; 'Missing required files for {pipeline}.' when the pipeline's required file combination is absent; and 'Unsupported trace link type: ...' for a type outside the four known pipelines.",
