      "id": "claim_5f54a9fc4d714c48a6cfddf88e48742d",
      "statement": "Polling failures and the still-processing timeout on /view/[id] surface in LoadingErrorModal, whose Retry handler clears the error and restarts pollForResult with a fresh local AbortController and whose View Files Only handler clears the error and stops the loading state, rendering the result panels without parsed trace links.",
